module bankr-miw-local-rules.local-rules

import core.frbp9006.{ frbp9006 }
import frbp.events.{ FirstMeetingDate, PetitionFiled }

// The Bankr. W.D. Mich. court's own periods and page limits, counted under
// FRBP 9006(a), the FRCP 6(a) method: the Local Bankruptcy Rules effective
// October 11, 2026. The FRBP periods (schedules, claims, the chapter 13
// plan, discharge, dischargeability, exemptions, the adversary answer,
// appeals) are lit/frbp's and are not declared again, nor are the national
// periods the rules repeat: payment advices on the petition date or within
// 14 days (LBR 1007-2(e)(1), FRBP 1007(c)) and the attorney's FRBP 2016(b)
// disclosure within 14 days after the order for relief and its supplement
// within 14 days (LBR 2016-1(a), (c)). Stated in the rules but not
// declared: the business-day periods (notice of courtroom electronic
// equipment five business days before a hearing, LBR 9016); the clerk's own
// scheduling (a preliminary stay hearing within 30 days of the motion and a
// final hearing within 30 more, 4001-1(c)) and the transcript access
// periods (90 days of restricted access, 9037-1(a)); deadlines that are
// another date (withdrawal of the reference by the first meeting date or
// the answer date, 5011(b); jury consent by the joint final pretrial order
// date, 9015); the trustee's permission to begin adequate protection
// payments 28 days after a claim (3016(b)); a stricken document refiled
// within 14 days relating back (5005-2(c)), a cure rather than a deadline;
// and the conditions of an emergency (a hearing needed in less than 7 days,
// 9013(h)) and of a deferred discharge (30 days after the order,
// 4004-1(a)).
/// A Mediation Summary, excluding exhibits and attachments (LBR
/// 9019-13(c)).
limit mediation-summary {
  pages <= 15 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-13(c)"
} cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-13(c)"

/// A Standard Case Evaluation summary (LBR 9019-22(b)).
limit case-evaluation-summary {
  pages <= 20 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-22(b)"
} cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-22(b)"

/// An order converting a chapter 11, 12 or 13 case to chapter 7 is entered
/// other than on the debtor's motion (LBR 1007-2(d)(2)).
event InvoluntaryConversionOrdered()
/// An application to employ a professional is entered on the docket (LBR
/// 2014(b)).
event EmploymentApplicationEntered()
/// A chapter 12 or 13 petition is filed (LBR 2016-1(d), 3015(b)).
event Chapter12Or13PetitionFiled()
/// A pre-confirmation chapter 13 plan amendment is served on an adversely
/// affected creditor or party in interest (LBR 3015(e)(5)).
event PlanAmendmentServed()
/// An expedited order approving use of cash collateral or credit is served
/// (LBR 4001-2(c)(5)).
event FinancingOrderServed()
/// An unsecured creditors' committee is formed (LBR 4001-2(c)(5)).
event CommitteeFormed()
/// The Clerk's order granting or denying a debtor's first motion to defer
/// discharge is entered on the docket (LBR 4004-1(c)).
event ClerkDischargeDelayOrdered()
/// A notice of rejection or an order striking a document is served (LBR
/// 5005-2(d)).
event ClerkRejectionServed()
/// The Clerk serves notice that a document LBR 1007-2 requires with the
/// petition was not filed (LBR 5005-2(f)).
event DeficiencyNoticeServed()
/// The motion, application or objection initiating a contested matter is
/// served (LBR 5011(b)).
event ContestedMatterInitiated()
/// A pleading or paper first raising the reason for withdrawing the
/// reference is filed (LBR 5011(b)).
event WithdrawalGroundsRaised()
/// The movant's designation of record for a motion to withdraw the
/// reference is served (LBR 5011(d)).
event WithdrawalDesignationServed()
/// A motion to withdraw the reference is served (LBR 5011(e)).
event WithdrawalMotionServed()
/// An objection to a motion to withdraw the reference is served (LBR
/// 5011(e)).
event WithdrawalObjectionServed()
/// A chapter 13 debtor's sale of property closes (LBR 6004(b)).
event Chapter13SaleClosed()
/// Counsel notify the Court of a settlement of an adversary proceeding (LBR
/// 7090).
event SettlementNotified()
/// An order granting pro hac vice admission is entered (LBR 9010-3(c)).
event ProHacViceOrderEntered()
/// The Notice to File Statement of Social Security Number(s) issues (LBR
/// 9011).
event SsnNoticeIssued()
/// A motion with notice and opportunity to object is served (LBR 9013(c)).
event NoticeMotionServed()
/// A notice-and-opportunity motion on a matter under FRBP 2002(a) or 2016
/// is served (LBR 9013(c)).
event FeeNoticeMotionServed()
/// A notice-and-opportunity motion under FRBP 3002.1(f) or (g) is served
/// (LBR 9013(c)).
event MortgageMotionServed()
/// An objection to a claim with notice and opportunity to respond is served
/// (LBR 9013(c)).
event ClaimObjectionServed()
/// The chapter 13 trustee serves a motion to dismiss the case (LBR
/// 9013(d)).
event TrusteeDismissalMotionServed()
/// The United States Trustee serves a § 707(a) motion to dismiss for
/// failure to file schedules and statements (LBR 9013(e)).
event UstDismissalMotionServed()
/// The hearing the Clerk schedules on a motion not filed under LBR 9013(c)
/// is set to be held (LBR 9013(f)).
event ContestedHearingScheduled()
/// An order referring a matter to the Bankruptcy Alternative Dispute
/// Resolution Program is entered (LBR 9019-9).
event ReferralOrderEntered()
/// The initial scheduling conference in an adversary proceeding is set to
/// be held (LBR 9019-11(a)).
event SchedulingConferenceSet()
/// The mediator's initial telephone conference with the parties is held
/// (LBR 9019-13(b)).
event MediatorTelephoneConferenceHeld()
/// The Mediation Conference is scheduled to be held (LBR 9019-13(c)).
event MediationConferenceScheduled()
/// A Mediation Conference concludes (LBR 9019-17(b)).
event MediationConferenceConcluded()
/// The mediator bills counsel or a pro se party (LBR 9019-19(c)).
event MediatorBilled()
/// The ADR Administrator gives notice of the selection of the case
/// evaluators (LBR 9019-22(a)).
event EvaluatorsSelectionNoticed()
/// A case evaluation award is served (LBR 9019-22(e), 9019-23(e)).
event CaseEvaluationAwardServed()
/// A Blue Ribbon Case Evaluation hearing concludes in an extraordinary case
/// (LBR 9019-23(d)).
event BlueRibbonHearingConcluded()
/// An electronic transcript is filed (LBR 9037-1(b)).
event TranscriptFiled()
/// A Mediation Summary is submitted to the mediator (LBR 9019-13(c)).
event MediationSummarySubmitted() paper mediation-summary
/// A case evaluation summary is submitted to the evaluators (LBR
/// 9019-22(b)).
event CaseEvaluationSummarySubmitted() paper case-evaluation-summary

/// LBR 1007-2(d)(2): on an involuntary conversion to chapter 7, the debtor
/// files the asset protection report within 7 days after entry of the
/// conversion order.
deadline conversion-asset-report-period: 7.days after InvoluntaryConversionOrdered() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 1007-2(d)"

/// LBR 1007-2(e)(2): in an individual chapter 7, 12 or 13 case, the debtor
/// submits to the trustee the tax returns, account statements, titles,
/// deeds, insurance declarations, retirement statements, divorce papers and
/// domestic support information at least 7 days before the date first set
/// for the meeting of creditors.
deadline trustee-documents-period: 7.days before FirstMeetingDate() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 1007-2(e)"

/// LBR 1007-2(f)(1): a creditor's request for payment advices is timely if
/// filed and served no later than 14 days before the date first set for the
/// meeting of creditors.
deadline payment-advices-request-period: 14.days before FirstMeetingDate() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 1007-2(f)"

/// LBR 1007-2(g)(1): a creditor's § 521(e)(2)(A)(ii) request for pre-
/// petition tax information is timely if filed and served no later than 14
/// days before the date first set for the meeting of creditors.
deadline tax-information-request-period: 14.days before FirstMeetingDate() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 1007-2(g)"

/// LBR 2014(b)(1)-(2): the United States Trustee may object to an
/// application to employ a professional within 28 days from its entry;
/// absent objection the applicant may certify no response.
deadline employment-objection-period: 28.days after EmploymentApplicationEntered() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 2014(b)"

/// LBR 2016-1(d): in chapter 12 and 13, no more than 21 days after the
/// petition a professional seeking compensation as an administrative
/// expense files the executed fee agreement and serves the trustee and the
/// United States Trustee.
deadline fee-agreement-period: 21.days after Chapter12Or13PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 2016-1(d)"

/// LBR 3015(b): a chapter 13 case filed without schedules, statements or a
/// plan may be dismissed without further hearing unless the debtor files
/// them, or moves to extend, within 14 days of the petition (or the case
/// was converted to chapter 13).
deadline chapter13-documents-period: 14.days after Chapter12Or13PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 3015(b)"

/// LBR 3015(e)(5): an adversely affected creditor or party in interest that
/// does not consent to a pre-confirmation plan amendment files an objection
/// within 21 days of its service.
deadline plan-amendment-objection-period: 21.days after PlanAmendmentServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 3015(e)"

/// LBR 4001-2(c)(5)(A): an expedited cash collateral or credit order
/// entered without a hearing provides that objections are due within 14
/// days from its service.
deadline financing-order-objection-period: 14.days after FinancingOrderServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 4001-2(c)"

/// LBR 4001-2(c)(5)(A): an unsecured creditors' committee may object within
/// 14 days of its formation.
deadline committee-financing-objection-period: 14.days after CommitteeFormed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 4001-2(c)"

/// LBR 4001-5: a motion to extend the stay under § 362(c)(3) is filed
/// within 7 days of the filing of the petition.
deadline stay-extension-motion-period: 7.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 4001-5"

/// LBR 4004-1(c): a party objecting to the Clerk's action on a motion to
/// defer discharge may move for judicial review within 21 days after the
/// Clerk's order is entered on the docket.
deadline discharge-delay-review-period: 21.days after ClerkDischargeDelayOrdered() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 4004-1(c)"

/// LBR 5005-2(d): an entity affected by a notice of rejection or an order
/// striking a document may move for judicial review within 14 days of its
/// service.
deadline clerk-action-review-period: 14.days after ClerkRejectionServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 5005-2(d)"

/// LBR 5005-2(f): if a document LBR 1007-2 requires with the petition is
/// not filed and the deficiency is not corrected within 14 days of service
/// of the Clerk's notice, the case may be dismissed without further
/// hearing.
deadline missing-document-cure-period: 14.days after DeficiencyNoticeServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 5005-2(f)"

/// LBR 5011(b): a motion to withdraw the reference of a contested matter is
/// filed not later than 14 days after service of the motion, application or
/// objection initiating it.
deadline contested-withdrawal-period: 14.days after ContestedMatterInitiated() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 5011(b)"

/// LBR 5011(b): a motion to withdraw the reference may still be filed
/// within 14 days of the filing of the pleading or paper that first raises
/// the reason for it.
deadline late-withdrawal-period: 14.days after WithdrawalGroundsRaised() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 5011(b)"

/// LBR 5011(d): within 14 days after service of the movant's designation of
/// record, any other party may designate additional portions.
deadline withdrawal-designation-period: 14.days after WithdrawalDesignationServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 5011(d)"

/// LBR 5011(e): a party opposing withdrawal of the reference files and
/// serves its objection within 14 days of service of the motion.
deadline withdrawal-objection-period: 14.days after WithdrawalMotionServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 5011(e)"

/// LBR 5011(e): the movant may file and serve a reply within 14 days after
/// service of the objection.
deadline withdrawal-reply-period: 14.days after WithdrawalObjectionServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 5011(e)"

/// LBR 6004(b): a chapter 13 debtor who sells property provides the closing
/// statement to the chapter 13 trustee within 14 days after closing.
deadline closing-statement-period: 14.days after Chapter13SaleClosed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 6004(b)"

/// LBR 7090: unless otherwise ordered, counsel submit the order disposing
/// of a settled adversary proceeding within 14 days after notifying the
/// Court of the settlement; failure may be cause for dismissal.
deadline settlement-order-period: 14.days after SettlementNotified() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 7090"

/// LBR 9010-3(c)-(d): the pro hac vice admission fee is paid to the Clerk
/// within 14 days of entry of the order granting admission, or the
/// privilege to appear is revoked.
deadline pro-hac-vice-fee-period: 14.days after ProHacViceOrderEntered() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9010-3(c)"

/// LBR 9011: failure to submit Official Form 121 within 14 days from the
/// date of the Notice to File Statement of Social Security Number(s)
/// results in dismissal without further hearing.
deadline ssn-statement-period: 14.days after SsnNoticeIssued() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9011"

/// LBR 9013(c)(1)(A): a party served with a notice-and-opportunity motion
/// has 14 days from service to file and serve a response or request for
/// hearing.
deadline notice-motion-response-period: 14.days after NoticeMotionServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9013(c)"

/// LBR 9013(c)(1)(A): 21 days from service for matters under FRBP 2002(a)
/// and 2016.
deadline fee-notice-motion-response-period: 21.days after FeeNoticeMotionServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9013(c)"

/// LBR 9013(c)(1)(A): 28 days from service for motions under FRBP 3002.1(f)
/// and (g).
deadline mortgage-motion-response-period: 28.days after MortgageMotionServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9013(c)"

/// LBR 9013(c)(1)(A): 30 days from service for objections to claims.
deadline claim-objection-response-period: 30.days after ClaimObjectionServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9013(c)"

/// LBR 9013(d): the debtor files and serves on the chapter 13 trustee any
/// response or request for hearing within 30 days of service of the
/// trustee's motion to dismiss.
deadline trustee-dismissal-response-period: 30.days after TrusteeDismissalMotionServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9013(d)"

/// LBR 9013(e): the debtor files and serves on the United States Trustee
/// any response or request for hearing within 30 days of service of a §
/// 707(a) motion to dismiss for failure to file schedules and statements.
deadline ust-dismissal-response-period: 30.days after UstDismissalMotionServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9013(e)"

/// LBR 9013(f): absent good cause, a brief or response to a motion not
/// filed under LBR 9013(c) is filed and served at least 7 days before the
/// scheduled hearing.
deadline contested-brief-period: 7.days before ContestedHearingScheduled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9013(f)"

/// LBR 9019-9(b): a party objecting to referral to the ADR Program may file
/// an objection within 14 days of the order of referral.
deadline referral-objection-period: 14.days after ReferralOrderEntered() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-9(b)"

/// LBR 9019-9(d): within 14 days after the order referring a matter to the
/// Program, the parties agree on one mediator (or three Blue Ribbon case
/// evaluators).
deadline neutral-selection-period: 14.days after ReferralOrderEntered() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-9(d)"

/// LBR 9019-11(a): unless otherwise ordered, no later than 14 days before
/// the initial scheduling conference in an adversary proceeding, counsel
/// confer and discuss ADR options.
deadline adr-conference-period: 14.days before SchedulingConferenceSet() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-11(a)"

/// LBR 9019-13(b): within 14 days of the telephone conference, the mediator
/// gives notice of the time and place of the mediation.
deadline mediation-notice-period: 14.days after MediatorTelephoneConferenceHeld() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-13(b)"

/// LBR 9019-13(c): at the mediator's request, each party submits its
/// Mediation Summary no later than seven days before the Mediation
/// Conference.
deadline mediation-summary-period: 7.days before MediationConferenceScheduled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-13(c)"

/// LBR 9019-17(b): within 14 days following the conclusion of a Mediation
/// Conference, the mediator files and serves a report.
deadline mediator-report-period: 14.days after MediationConferenceConcluded() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-17(b)"

/// LBR 9019-19(c): counsel and pro se parties pay the mediator's bills in
/// full within 30 days of billing or as otherwise agreed.
deadline mediator-bill-period: 30.days after MediatorBilled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-19(c)"

/// LBR 9019-22(a)(2): each party pays the $300 case evaluation fee within
/// 14 days of the notice of selection of the case evaluators.
deadline case-evaluation-fee-period: 14.days after EvaluatorsSelectionNoticed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-22(a)"

/// LBR 9019-22(e), 9019-23(e): a party that does not file an acceptance or
/// rejection of a case evaluation award within 14 days of its service is
/// deemed to reject it.
deadline case-evaluation-acceptance-period: 14.days after CaseEvaluationAwardServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-22(e)"

/// LBR 9019-23(d): in an extraordinary case, the Blue Ribbon evaluators
/// render their written evaluation no later than seven days after the
/// hearing concludes.
deadline blue-ribbon-award-period: 7.days after BlueRibbonHearingConcluded() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9019-23(d)"

/// LBR 9037-1(b)(1): a person wishing to redact personal identifiers files
/// a Notice of Intent to Request Redaction and serves the transcriber
/// within 7 days after the transcript is filed.
deadline redaction-notice-period: 7.days after TranscriptFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9037-1(b)"

/// LBR 9037-1(b)(1): the Request for Redaction is submitted within 21 days
/// of the transcript's filing.
deadline redaction-request-period: 21.days after TranscriptFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "W.D. Mich. LBR 9037-1(b)"
